# Cross-run skill library: the agent-registration fingerprint cache (Feature 3) is a
# local cache, not source. Forged SKILL.md files under .agents/skills/<name>/ ARE meant
# to be committed (that's how skills accumulate across runs).
.agents/.skill_fingerprint
